# MCU rules (`apps/mcu` — POXY OS staff console)

- **Do not touch MCU unless the session explicitly declares `apps/mcu` as
  its zone.** Game-facing sessions (web, supabase) never "drive-by edit"
  the admin.
- MCU is Next.js + Tailwind and keeps its own visual language. Do NOT apply
  Sky player-facing tokens or the dual-environment system here.
- Access model stays: middleware gate via Supabase auth + `admin_emails`
  lookup. Never weaken it, never add public routes beyond
  `/`, `/login`, `/unauthorized`, `/api/health`.
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` is server-only (middleware, route handlers).
  It must never reach a client component or `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` var.
- Branding: AETRYX LTD replaces NULLSPACE LABS in MCU chrome — but only in
  a session scoped to MCU.
- The legacy staff terminal (`archive/prototype-v1/assets/admin-terminal.html`)
  is retired reference material; do not resurrect it.
